  "description": "Paper 3 design 5 (spec \u00a76 'Risa outbreak', ~500 runs): FICTIONAL tourism-port scenario \u2014 a large importation onto a hull whose next calls have weak port programmes, so shipboard detection is the only fast channel. Importation is represented as initial_infected=5 at embarkation; the port-side asymmetry lives in the shore/port post-processing layer, not in a new engine mechanism. Hourly clock, drawn-incubation arm.",
